1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:02,438
PSG 2, Aston Villa 1.

2
00:00:02,438 --> 00:00:06,442
6 shots on target turned into the win.

3
00:00:06,442 --> 00:00:08,444
Start with the baseline.

4
00:00:08,444 --> 00:00:12,198
Neither side could claim the
baseline counts.

5
00:00:12,198 --> 00:00:14,200
Pass share was 59 to 41.

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,787
Kvaratskhelia opened it in
the 19th minute.

7
00:00:17,787 --> 00:00:23,542
3 goals later it finished 2-1, Doué
having the final say in the 60th.

8
00:00:23,542 --> 00:00:26,752
PSG took 12 shots and put 6 on target.

9
00:00:26,752 --> 00:00:30,722
Aston Villa took 15 and hit
the target 4 times.

10
00:00:30,722 --> 00:00:36,550
Blocked efforts are marked separately,
because a block is not a save.

11
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:42,185
This is attacking pressure in five minute
blocks, built from final-third passes,

12
00:00:42,185 --> 00:00:44,227
box entries, shots and goals.

13
00:00:44,227 --> 00:00:49,017
The biggest surge belongs to Aston Villa
in the 40-44 minute window.

14
00:00:49,017 --> 00:00:50,494
PSG win it 2-1.

15
00:00:50,494 --> 00:00:57,192
6 shots on target, 3 big chances, and a
result that matches the map.
